# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Monorepo — environment variable guide
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# This monorepo uses app-local .env files.
# Each app ships its own .env.example — copy it to .env inside that app's directory.
#
# App-local env files:
#   apps/server/.env.example  →  copy to  apps/server/.env
#
# Quick start:
#   cp apps/server/.env.example apps/server/.env
#
# Do NOT put real secrets in this file or commit any .env file.
# See each app's .env.example for the full list of variables with descriptions.
